<concept base="Top" importance="optional" id="t00258">
	<title id="e01673">Side air bag and front center air bag </title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>air bag
					<indexterm>side air bag</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<p>Your vehicle is equipped with a side air bag in each front and front center air bag in front driver side seat.</p>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e01674">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e01675">
								<image href="images/N_SP327_B06_045.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<fig id="e01676">
								<image href="images/N_SP327_B06_044.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>The actual air bags in the vehicle may differ from the illustration.</p>
		<ol outputclass="callout" id="e01677">
			<li>
				<p>Side air bag</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
		<p>The side air bags and front center air bag are designed to deploy only during certain side-impact collisions, depending on the crash severity. The side air bags and driver’s center air bag are not designed to deploy in all side impact situations.</p>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e01678">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e01679">
								<image href="images/N_SP327_B06_046.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<fig id="e01680">
								<image href="images/N_SP327_B06_047.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>The actual air bags in the vehicle may differ from the illustration.</p>
		<ol outputclass="callout_continue" id="e01681">
			<li>
				<p>Front center side air bag</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
		<note type="note" id="e01682">
			<p>Refer to the WARNING, CAUTION and NOTE of <xref href="t00251.dita#t00251"/>.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
